  "steps": [
    {"instruction": "Heat oil in a large saucepan over high heat. Add chicken. Cook, stirring, for 4 to 5 minutes or until browned. Add onion. Cook, stirring, for 2 minutes or until softened. Add curry paste. Cook, stirring, for 30 seconds or until fragrant."},
    {"instruction": "Add coconut milk, stock, fish sauce and lime juice. Bring to the boil. Reduce heat to medium-low. Simmer for 10 minutes or until thickened slightly. Add beans and zucchini. Cook for 5 minutes or until chicken and vegetables are tender."},
    {"instruction": "Add coriander. Stir to combine. Serve with steamed jasmine rice."}
  ]
